            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Chick Bread Restaurant",
            "review_text": "NewfoundNomad\nAlberta, Canada16 contributions\n0\nNot as good as I had hoped\nOct 2017\nI went to Chick Bread simply because it looked like it a fast-food type of spot. I expected maybe some chicken wings, garlic bread, or maybe some pizza-type options.\n\nThe place was clean and their wi-fi was fine, but the food was disappointing. It was greasy and not very appetizing. Maybe it would make for good 'drunk-food' but that's not what I went there for.\n\nNot sure that I'd try this place again. I went there when I was knew to the area and didn't know of many other places. There are better options in Ha Long for fast food.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 22, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-12",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
