            "review_text": "Shahin S\n155 contributions\n0\nOverrated restaurant\nJun 2017\nI believe that the price is quite high if you compare to the same food in other restaurants in the area. \n\nThe sandwiches was not even comparable with other restaurants sandwiches if you take the price in act. It did not meet my expectations.\n\nHowever, they had alot to choose from which is a big plus. They had cheese sticks, hot wings, pizzas, sandwiches and more!\nRead more\nWritten June 23, 2017",
